@startuml Activity - KYC Flow
!theme plain
skinparam monochrome true
start
:Show KYC intro & legal notices;
if (Resume within deadline?) then (Yes)
:Load saved progress;
else (No)
:Start new KYC session;
endif
:STEP1 본인확인 (CI/휴대폰 인증);
:STEP2 고객확인 정보 입력;
:STEP3 신분증 인증 (OCR, liveness);
:STEP4 계좌 인증 (1KRW micro-deposit or bank API);
:Collect required consents (필수/선택);
:Submit;
:Show pending message;
:Route to review;
stop
@enduml
